  "ligand_choice": "Largest non-cofactor het group with >= 10 heavy atoms; cofactor only if nothing else qualifies. Prevents several entries of one protein all validating on its shared cofactor. PEG oligomers are excluded as cryoprotectant; haem and its analogues count as cofactors."
